  "definition": "Eligible Fuel",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#9998, eff 9-20-11; ss by #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.09) New. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.10); ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.08)",
